    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Fruit Bowl</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Fruit_Bowl.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Fruit Bowl.png\"><img alt=\"Fruit Bowl.png\" src=\"/images/Fruit_Bowl.png?66966\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"rare\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;9Fruit Bowl\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Consumable//&amp;7Click on a player while holding this/&amp;7item to add the name of their profile/&amp;7to this item.//&amp;7Find one of each default profile/&amp;7name to reset this item and/&amp;7permanently gain &amp;3+1☯ Farming/&amp;3Wisdom &amp;7and &amp;6250,000 Coins&amp;7.//&amp;7Names missing:/&amp;bApple&amp;7, &amp;bBanana&amp;7, &amp;bBlueberry&amp;7, &amp;bCucumber&amp;7, &amp;bCoconut&amp;7,/&amp;bGrapes&amp;7, &amp;bKiwi&amp;7, &amp;bLemon&amp;7, &amp;bLime&amp;7, &amp;bMango&amp;7, &amp;bOrange&amp;7,/&amp;bPapaya&amp;7, &amp;bPineapple&amp;7, &amp;bPeach&amp;7, &amp;bPear&amp;7, &amp;bPomegranate&amp;7,/&amp;bRaspberry&amp;7, &amp;bStrawberry&amp;7, &amp;bTomato&amp;7, &amp;bWatermelon&amp;7,/&amp;bZucchini//&amp;8You may only gain the bonus once!//&amp;9&amp;lRARE\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Fruit Bowl\"><img alt=\"Fruit Bowl.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Fruit_Bowl.png/32px-Fruit_Bowl.png?66966\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fruit_Bowl.png/64px-Fruit_Bowl.png?66966 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nItem</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Auction House <span style=\"text-decoration:underline dashed\"><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/item/FRUIT_BOWL\">Prices</a></span></span><b><sup><abbr class=\"auction-house-info-icon auction-house-info-icon-no-time\" title=\"Values are updated every 15 minutes from Hypixel&#39;s API.\">ⓘ</abbr></sup></b></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Latest)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiY3VycmVudCIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IkZSVUlUX0JPV0wifQ==\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Daily Average)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYXZlcmFnZSIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IkZSVUlUX0JPV0wifQ==\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>FRUIT_BOWL</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Fruit Bowl</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fruit_Bowl?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fruit_Bowl?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Fruit Bowl</b> has a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">0.2%</span> (<span class=\"light-color color-green\">1</span> in <span class=\"light-color color-green\">500</span>) chance to be rewarded from completing a <a href=\"/w/Garden\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Garden\">Garden</a> visitor offer.\n</p><p><b>Fruit Bowl</b> can also be obtained as a Minor Reward during <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> event, or from the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century\" title=\"Gift Bag of the Century\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png/21px-Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png?68bdb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png/42px-Gift_Bag_of_the_Century.png?68bdb 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Gift_Bag_of_the_Century\" title=\"Gift Bag of the Century\">Gift Bag of the Century</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fruit_Bowl?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fruit_Bowl?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The player can click on any other player while holding a <b>Fruit Bowl</b> to add the name of their profile to the item. \n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\"><span class=\"format-l\">FRUIT BOWL! </span></span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;player&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">'s profile name is </span><span class=\"format-a\">&lt;profile&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">&lt;profile&gt; has been added to the fruit bowl!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>If the profile name has already been found, the result will be:\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\"><span class=\"format-l\">FRUIT BOWL! </span></span><span class=\"format-b\">&lt;player&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">'s profile name is </span><span class=\"format-a\">&lt;profile&gt;</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\">You already found this profile name in your bowl!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>Finding each default profile name will reset the item and grant the player a permanent <span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\">+1</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Farming_Wisdom\" title=\"Farming Wisdom\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;aqua\" style=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">☯&#160;</span>Farming Wisdom</span></a></span> and <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>250,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>. The player may only gain the bonus once.\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-2\"><span class=\"format-l\">FRUITALICIOUS! </span></span><span class=\"format-a\">You completed your fruit bowl and gained its permanent bonus!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">That also comes with a one-time reward of </span><span class=\"format-6\">250,000 Coins</span><span class=\"format-e\">!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>The bonus is a one time reward. If the player finds all profile names again they will receive nothing but a message in chat.\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-2\"><span class=\"format-l\">FRUITALICIOUS! </span></span><span class=\"format-a\">You completed your fruit bowl!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">You had already gained the bonus, so... at least everyone knows you love fruits now!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>All default profile names can be seen below.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Apple</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Banana</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Blueberry</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Coconut</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Cucumber</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Grapes</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Kiwi</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Lemon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Lime</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Mango</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Orange</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Papaya</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Pear</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Peach</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Pineapple</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Pomegranate</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Raspberry</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Strawberry</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Tomato</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Watermelon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">Zucchini</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Fruit_Bowl?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Fruit_Bowl?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">Aug&#160;31,&#160;2023</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Fruit_Bowl.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Fruit_Bowl.png/26px-Fruit_Bowl.png?66966\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fruit_Bowl.png/52px-Fruit_Bowl.png?66966 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Fruit Bowl</b>.</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2023/September_2\" title=\"Changelog/2023/September 2\">Sep&#160;2,&#160;2023</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Fruit_Bowl.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Fruit_Bowl.png/26px-Fruit_Bowl.png?66966\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Fruit_Bowl.png/52px-Fruit_Bowl.png?66966 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Fruit Bowl</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/March_25\" title=\"Changelog/2025/March 25\">Mar&#160;25,&#160;2025</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.22.1</th><td>Added <b>Fruit Bowl</b> as a rare reward from <a href=\"/w/Garden\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Garden\">Garden</a> visitors.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐hq4kj\nCached time: 20261023052103\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision]\nCPU time usage: 1.517 seconds\nReal time usage: 2.600 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 797/1000000\nRevision size: 2333/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 21977/8388608 